          explanation: 'This is why financial advisors ask about risk tolerance. The efficient frontier framework doesn\'t tell you which portfolio to pick, it tells you the best possible tradeoff between risk and return. Your job is to decide how much risk you\'re willing to accept, then the optimization tells you the highest return you can achieve at that risk level.'
