      'Prudent duration extension, waiting for wider credit spreads, and positioning for recession, scoring 9/9.',
      'Fixed income analytics, duration, convexity, yield curve analysis, and credit spreads, are not abstract concepts but practical risk management tools governing a $130 trillion market. The 2022 bond crash proved that ignorance of duration is financially catastrophic, even for "safe" government bonds. The quants who master these analytics don\'t just measure risk, they manage it, and that is the difference between a $700M pension deficit and a fully funded plan.'
