      {label:'Vasicek, it\'s the simplest rate model',outcome:'Vasicek can\'t fit the yield curve, doesn\'t capture volatility smiles, and would misprice the Bermudan swaption significantly. While simple, it\'s inadequate for exotic rate products that depend on accurate yield curve dynamics.',correct:false}
