            { label: 'Multi-factor LMM calibrated to the full swaption matrix, it captures term structure dynamics and forward rate correlations essential for long-dated exotics', consequence: 'Correct. A 30-year callable range accrual depends on the joint evolution of rates at multiple maturities, the volatility smile (range boundary), and optimal exercise (callability). Multi-factor LMM captures all these features and calibrates to the full swaption surface.', score: 3 },
            { label: 'Black-Scholes, adapt it for rates', consequence: 'Black-Scholes doesn\'t model interest rate dynamics at all. It can\'t handle the mean reversion, term structure, or rate-specific features that are essential for pricing this exotic.', score: 0 }
