      'You\'ve built quant strategies using statistical models and mathematical formulas. Now you\'ll see how machine learning takes this further, letting algorithms discover patterns you\'d never think to look for. But ML in finance is tricky: overfitting is the #1 killer. This lesson shows how to use ML rigorously.',
