            { label: 'Approve if the best feature combination has economic rationale', consequence: 'Economic rationale helps but doesn\'t solve the multiple testing problem. If you tested 500 combinations and selected post-hoc, even a plausible rationale might be a just-so story fitted to the winning combination. The deflated Sharpe is still necessary.', score: 1 }
