          explanation: 'Consider: an AI model predicts a stock will rise. But why? Is the signal from a legitimate factor (value, momentum) or from a data artifact? Will it survive transaction costs? Is it robust to regime changes? Does it make economic sense? These questions require human judgment, mathematical reasoning combined with financial understanding. AI provides predictions; human quants provide understanding.'
