            { label: 'Run both and see which performs better in 6 months', consequence: 'Running Strategy A wastes capital and time on a likely-overfit strategy. The quantitative evidence (no walk-forward, 100 parameter tests, concentrated) strongly predicts failure. A 6-month pilot for Strategy A would likely lose money. Invest the time and capital in expanding Strategy B.', score: 1 }
